<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92180" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥᾰπίζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαπίς</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strike with a stick,
				cudgel, thrash</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Xenoph.
				7.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hippon.
				64
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.35
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				223
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				25.57
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jd.</u>
				16.25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				8.6.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Ir.</u>
				p.40
			</span></i> W.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ ῥάβδῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Anacreont.</u>
					29.2
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. ἐκ τῶν ἀγώνων</span>
			<i>to be flogged</i> off the course, <i><span class="en">
				Heraclit.
				42
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.59
			</span></i>: 
				Ion.
			
			pf.
			part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥεραπισμένα νῶτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anacr.
					166
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>slap in the face</i> (later for 
				Att.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ κόρρης πατάξαι</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἐπὶ κόρρης ῥ</span>. (metaph.) <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.713c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ κόρρης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ach.Tat.
					2.24
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὴν σιαγόνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
					5.39
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαπισθῆναί τε καὶ πληγὰς λαβεῖν
					ἁπαλαῖσι χερσίν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Timocl.
					22.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρραπίσθη τὴν γνάθον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hyp.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					97
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				300
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαπίζειν</span> distd. from
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολαφίζειν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				26.67
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> generally,
				<i>strike, beat</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν
			ἀέρα</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>de An.</u>
				419b23
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				368a16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				370a14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				398
			</span></i>.</div>
